        <body>
            <div xml:id="d215-a1">

                <pb facs="d215-6" n="6" sameAs="frus:frus1958-60v03mSupp/d215-6"/>


                <head>Memorandum From Smith (S/P) to Krebs</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName>Washington</placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1959-12-09">December 9,
                        1959</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <pb facs="d215-7" n="7" type="facsimile" xml:id="d215-7"/>
                <p>The attached memo of November 18 was returned today.</p>
                <p>I would much appreciate knowing whether or not the recommendation on page 5
                    commended itself to the Secretary.</p>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Encl.</p>
                    <p>Memo, re long-range security policy [S/P–59204–1A]</p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
